Third-party components
----------------------

None. Rota has no third-party dependency and no CDN.

Vendored from this project's own kits (same licence, same author), copied verbatim on
25/11/2026:

- web-kit 0.1.0 — docs/play/web-kit.js — the offline shell, storage helpers and PWA registration
- export-kit 1.0.0 — docs/play/export-kit.js — Blob download, used to print the rota

Neither kit is modified. Neither makes a network request.

On pay
------

Three specs were absorbed into this app and all three forbid the same thing: it does not calculate
pay. There is no rate, no salary, no currency and no money field in the engine. It counts shifts, and
the load per person is the fairness measure.
